WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:03.334
-Guys, like I said earlier,
everyone's talking about

00:00:03.334 --> 00:00:05.100
today's recall election
in California.

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:06.267
There are a lot of candidates

00:00:06.267 --> 00:00:08.334
trying to replace
Governor Gavin Newsom,

00:00:08.334 --> 00:00:09.868
so we wanted to break it all
down for you.

00:00:09.868 --> 00:00:12.534
It's time for "Fast Stats."
Here we go.

00:00:12.534 --> 00:00:15.200
-♪ Learn some fast stats,
fast stats ♪

00:00:15.200 --> 00:00:18.701
-First, we have Larry Elder.

00:00:18.701 --> 00:00:21.300
His job is
conservative radio host.

00:00:21.300 --> 00:00:25.434
Party trick -- Eating
an entire apple in two bites.

00:00:25.434 --> 00:00:27.067
Previous job --
Playing the principal

00:00:27.067 --> 00:00:29.834
on a Nickelodeon show where
he gets slimed every episode.

00:00:29.834 --> 00:00:32.634
[ Applause ]

00:00:32.634 --> 00:00:34.968
Next, we have Rhonda Furin.

00:00:34.968 --> 00:00:36.567
Job -- Self-employed.

00:00:36.567 --> 00:00:38.534
Former job --
Background exerciser

00:00:38.534 --> 00:00:41.100
in every '80s workout video.

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:43.601
Often mistaken for --
A woman on a "Dateline" episode

00:00:43.601 --> 00:00:45.234
who definitely
killed her husband.

00:00:45.234 --> 00:00:47.434
[ Applause ]

00:00:47.434 --> 00:00:49.934
Next up, it's Kevin Faulconer.

00:00:49.934 --> 00:00:52.133
Job --
Former mayor of San Diego.

00:00:52.133 --> 00:00:54.534
Wants to know -- "What's gonna
get you in the driver's seat

00:00:54.534 --> 00:00:57.834
of this 2005
Hyundai Elantra today?"

00:00:57.834 --> 00:00:59.434
First thing he'll do
in the office --

00:00:59.434 --> 00:01:01.100
Even out his spray tan.

00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:03.701
[ Applause ]

00:01:03.701 --> 00:01:05.200
Then we have Robert Newman.

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:06.734
Job -- Farmer.

00:01:06.734 --> 00:01:09.200
Currently --
FaceTiming his grandchildren

00:01:09.200 --> 00:01:11.133
too close to the camera.

00:01:11.133 --> 00:01:12.834
Last seen --
as a signed head shot

00:01:12.834 --> 00:01:14.734
on the wall
of an Italian restaurant.

00:01:14.734 --> 00:01:17.267
[ Applause ]

00:01:17.267 --> 00:01:19.167
And finally, it's David Moore.

00:01:19.167 --> 00:01:20.601
Job -- Teacher.

00:01:20.601 --> 00:01:23.033
Last person he upset --
His barber.

00:01:23.033 --> 00:01:27.167
Catalogue model for --
Clip-on ties.

00:01:27.167 --> 00:01:29.334
Campaign slogan --
"Don't call them comic books,

00:01:29.334 --> 00:01:31.400
they're graphic novels."

00:01:31.400 --> 00:01:34.100
This has been "Fast Stats,"
everybody.

00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:35.133
Thank you very much.

